IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cpf-withdrawal`

-- Central Provident Fund Act 1953, withdrawal, protection, death and nomination, from the member's seat -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case. The subsidiary legislation used is named in the module's header.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_central-provident-fund-act-1953_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a citizen aged 60 with $200,000, $60,000 of it medisave` MEANS `My account` WITH
    `I am a citizen or permanent resident of Singapore` IS TRUE
    `I am of a class prescribed as an applicable person for this provision` IS FALSE
    `my age in completed years` IS 60
    `I have already withdrawn on the ground of having attained 55` IS FALSE
    `a birthday, or the other period the Minister directs, has come round since then` IS FALSE
    `the Board has given its authority for the withdrawal` IS TRUE
    `the sum standing to my credit` IS 200000
    `the sum in my medisave account` IS 60000
    `the reserved amount in my ordinary account` IS 0
    `the retirement sum prescribed for me` IS 100000

